ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"1974ead8648418faf30edf619eeefa15d85d5c9484f3946854c41f0eb6b0fb98","event_uuid":"2a697683-56ab-4d54-ba4a-2dbdec1371aa","position":{"commit_sha":"6702e3aad3ca1f64ae421c738c3594b5361d02cc","position":"1786150926456118001-2a697683-56ab-4d54-ba4a-2dbdec1371aa"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"0fa685814f459e959c97ad91591630eff95b28b35747e7e177ceb4d08e3b70c3","event_uuid":"23e8bd7c-8982-4623-a84c-7e16fa06dd8c","position":{"commit_sha":"6702e3aad3ca1f64ae421c738c3594b5361d02cc","position":"1786150927120798001-23e8bd7c-8982-4623-a84c-7e16fa06dd8c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"fd36f12c222a6ad294cc4c9716bda70a01bd78a474193c3c278f824eeb4df6ed","event_uuid":"655c9d46-c9cf-4a4d-a66f-09e9f5be8ba2","position":{"commit_sha":"9f46a8e966538fadc80084aa293f611903374fae","position":"1786151360481755001-655c9d46-c9cf-4a4d-a66f-09e9f5be8ba2"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Root cause confirmed: Mode(str, Enum) inherits str.__gt__/__le__/__ge__; functools.total_ordering does not overwrite inherited operators, so reconcile-check ordering was lexical. RED: the real ref-backed gate round trip and direct BOOTSTRAP_THROTTLE > RECONCILE_CHECK assertion failed. GREEN: explicit rank-based <, <=, >, >= methods plus all-pairs five-mode coverage; focused mode/advisory-lock suites pass 14/14. Existing values, equality, from_str, MODE_CAPS, and stored gate strings are unchanged. make lint and make typecheck pass.","timestamp":1786151360481755001}],"created_at":1786150529260555001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"931ca9e5-4f75-464e-895f-77eca404ec84","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4ede-5c1a-9274-4225"},{"link_uuid":"b0f99065-5141-4e4c-86ef-e2f8f11ff89a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"a200-3a76-ed86-4d33"}],"description":"## Context\nThe real ref-backed reconcile-check continuity test exposed that Mode inherits str. functools.total_ordering does not replace rich comparison methods inherited from str, so Mode.__gt__ remains lexical instead of rank-based. As a result Mode.BOOTSTRAP_THROTTLE > Mode.RECONCILE_CHECK is false and check_phase_gate fails to block higher modes when the stored gate is reconcile-check.\n\n## Approach\n- Make every Mode rich comparison use the existing _ORDERED rank contract instead of inherited string lexical ordering.\n- Preserve equality, enum values, MODE_CAPS, from_str, and the five-mode ordering.\n- Extend the existing mode contract tests to exercise natural operators across the full five-mode order.\n- Reuse the real ref-backed test on parent 2c87 to prove reconcile-check blocks a higher mode while allowing the equal target.\n\n## Testing\nRun the focused mode and advisory-lock suites, then `make lint`, `make typecheck`, and `make test`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Mode rich comparisons follow reconcile-check < dry-run < bootstrap-strict < bootstrap-throttle < live for all operators.\n- [ ] The real ref-backed reconcile-check gate round trip blocks bootstrap-throttle and allows reconcile-check.\n- [ ] Existing mode strings, MODE_CAPS, from_str behavior, and legacy comparisons remain unchanged.\n- [ ] Focused tests, `make lint`, `make typecheck`, and `make test` pass.\n\n## Compatibility and rollback\nThis repairs the advertised rank semantics without changing persisted values or vocabulary. Reverting restores the lexical-comparison defect but does not require data migration.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/mode.py","reason":"Override inherited str rich comparisons with the existing rank contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_mode.py","reason":"Pin natural comparison operators across all five modes."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","2c87-80d5-755b-4026"],["relates_to","4ede-5c1a-9274-4225"],["relates_to","a200-3a76-ed86-4d33"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2c87-80d5-755b-4026","parent_status_uuid":"2a697683-56ab-4d54-ba4a-2dbdec1371aa","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["compatibility","bridge","reconciler"],"ticket_id":"3c6a-4999-7466-46b1","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Fix rank ordering for str-backed reconciler modes","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c88b9f75-af45-4d57-bec7-9b969e3c27a8","f08fe806-054b-4bcd-9c1c-65541b8fc29d","9685c403-e44e-40f3-8334-281433bc2f31","ea0605b5-b7f6-4ca1-b9ae-d6b28f43e28a","2a697683-56ab-4d54-ba4a-2dbdec1371aa","23e8bd7c-8982-4623-a84c-7e16fa06dd8c","655c9d46-c9cf-4a4d-a66f-09e9f5be8ba2","931ca9e5-4f75-464e-895f-77eca404ec84","b0f99065-5141-4e4c-86ef-e2f8f11ff89a"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786153524499520038,"uuid":"e5374ca8-a94c-48eb-8362-b5513c3ac189"}